h embedding"},"91":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-89","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"skills"},"92":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-90","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"{ dirs?, defs? }"},"93":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-91","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"disabled"},"94":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-92","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Claude Code-style skills: <dir>/<name>/SKILL.md (or <name>.md) with name:/description: frontmatter. Names + descriptions go in the system prompt; bodies load on demand via the use_skill tool"},"95":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-93","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"subagents"},"96":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-94","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"SubagentDef[]"},"97":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-95","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"none"},"98":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-96","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Named specialists exposed as agent_<name> delegation tools ({ name, description, system?, provider?, model?, tools?, inheritTools?, maxSteps? }); each runs an isolated reasoning loop"},"99":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-97","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"workflows"},"100":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-98","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"{ definitions?, store?, path?, expose? }"},"101":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-99","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"none"},"102":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-100","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Static workflow definitions; store: 'sqlite' persists to disk; expose: true | { run?, list?, build? } gives session turns workflow tools that run inside the session: run_workflow({ id, input }) and list_workflows() (on by default), and build_workflow({ task, name? }), which drafts a workflow with the model and runs it, saving it when named (opt-in)"},"103":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-101","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"context"},"104":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-102","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"{ encoding?, compactAt?, chunkSize?, strategy?, maxTools?, toolResultHandles?, compactToolResultsAbove?, compaction?, maxContextTokens?, promptCache? }"},"105":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-103","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"auto encoding; handles on; compact above 2048 chars; prompt cache on"},"106":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-104","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Context engine, compaction, MCP tool retrieval, tool result handles. maxTools (default 64) caps the MCP tools offered per run while tool search is off; above it they are ranked by keyword match with the task, but tools the run or session allows by name or glob (tools.allow) and every tool of a server connected at runtime (agent.mcp.connect, POST /mcp/add) always stay. compaction: 'llm' writes a model summary on compaction; promptCache enables Anthropic prompt caching (system, tools, conversation prefix)"},"107":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-105","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"toolSearch"},"108":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-106","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"boolean | \"auto\" | { enabled?, minTools?, minTokens?, alwaysLoad?, preselect?, results? }"},"109":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-107","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"\"auto\": on above 30 tools or ~10k tokens of definitions; 6 preselected; 5 per search"},"110":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-108","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Tool search: each model call gets the likely tools (keyword matches with the task, alwaysLoad names or globs, tools allowed by name), the system prompt lists the rest by server or category, and search_tools loads more mid-run; found tools stay loaded for the session. Works with every provider. false sends every tool"},"111":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-109","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"orchestration"},"112":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-110","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"{ parallel?, maxAgents?, planFirst?, planner? }"},"113":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-111","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"off; planner: 'llm'"},"114":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-112","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Parallel subagents with isolated context. planner controls plan-mode drafting: 'llm' asks the planning-routed model for steps (heuristic fallback), 'heuristic' splits the task text locally"},"115":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-113","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"budget"},"116":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-114","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"{ maxCostUsd?, maxTokens?, maxToolCalls?, maxDurationMs? }"},"117":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-115","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"unlimited"},"118":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-116","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Per-run resource ceilings. The run aborts with a BudgetExceededError (carrying limit + usage) as soon as any limit is crossed. Override per-run via run(task, { budget })"},"119":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-117","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"retry"},"120":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-118","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"{ maxRetries?, initialDelayMs?, maxDelayMs?, factor?, jitter?, retryOn? }"},"121":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-119","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"2 retries, 500ms→8s backoff"},"122":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-120","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Automatic retry of transient provider failures (network blips, 429, 5xx, 529) with exponential backoff. Retries only before any token is streamed, so output is never duplicated. retryOn overrides the built-in classifier"},"123":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-121","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"approvals"},"124":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-122","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"{ require?, policies?, autoApprove?, policy?, autoApproveAfterMs? }"},"125":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-123","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"none"},"126":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-124","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Per-tool auto | approve | deny; policy(tool, session) decides per call with the session's user, org and meta in hand; autoApproveAfterMs approves a request nobody (session or admin plane) decided in time, reported by: \"timeout\""},"127":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-125","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"hooks"},"128":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-126","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"{ beforeModel?, beforeTool?, afterTool?, onOutput? }"},"129":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-127","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"none"},"130":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-128","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Rewrite the messages or system prompt before each model call, rewrite or block a tool's arguments, redact its result, validate or replace the final answer. Each hook gets the session context"},"131":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-129","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"handoff"},"132":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-130","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"boolean | { enabled?, description? }"},"133":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-131","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"off"},"134":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-132","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Adds a handoff_to_human tool; calling it stops the run, emits handoff:request and sets result.handoff"},"135":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-133","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"askUser"},"136":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-134","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"boolean | 'auto'"},"137":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-135","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"'auto'"},"138":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-136","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Offer the ask_user tool. 'auto' offers it only when someone can answer: the run has onElicitation, or something listens for elicitation:request (a UI, serve()), so a script with no listener never stalls on a question. true always offers it, false never"},"139":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-137","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"thinking"},"140":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-138","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"{ budgetTokens } | false"},"141":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-139","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"off"},"142":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-140","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Extended thinking on every run (Anthropic; other providers ignore it). false turns reasoning off on models that reason by default (Nemotron on Nebius, NVIDIA and Ollama), for far fewer output tokens. Reasoning streams as thinking:* events; signed thinking is sent back with tool calls. RunOptions.thinking overrides (false turns it off)"},"143":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-141","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"logging"},"144":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-142","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"{ level?, otel?, destination? }"},"145":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-143","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"'info'"},"146":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-144","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Emits log events; otel is shorthand for telemetry: { sink: 'stdout' }"},"147":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-145","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"telemetry"},"148":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-146","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"{ endpoint?, apiKey?, sink?, onSpans?, service?, project?, env?, sample?, spans?, toolArgs?, payloads?, memory?, redact?, approvals?, headers? }"},"149":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-147","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"off (nothing exported)"},"150":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-148","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Opt-in observability. With the block present the agent exports agent-shaped spans (LLM calls with tokens and cost, tools, MCP, subagents, workflow steps, approvals, memory, RAG, compaction) to a collector such as @agentkit/telemetry. apiKey (default AGENTKIT_TELEMETRY_KEY) is the tenant's ak_… ingest key; project (default AGENTKIT_TELEMETRY_PROJECT or default) files the spans under a project in that tenant. Every content category (toolArgs, payloads, memory) is off by default; payloads: \"errors\" exports bodies only for a trace that failed; redact names keys dropped before export; onSpans(batch) taps every exported batch (alongside the sink, or on its own when no sink or endpoint is set). Spans go to endpoint, else AGENTKIT_TELEMETRY_URL; with neither (and no sink) they go nowhere but onSpans, so the block can stay in code that only reports where the variable is set. sink: \"stdout\" writes JSON lines instead. Remove the block and nothing is sent"},"151":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-149","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"harness"},"152":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-150","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"{ enabled?, record? }"},"153":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-151","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"off"},"154":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-152","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#createagentconfig","content":"Session record folder for replay"},"