] }, given each tool's description and argument schema. Validation (parseWorkflowGraph):"},"2346":{"id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic-45","page_id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/dynamic#lifecycle-and-events","content":"ids are short [A-Za-z0-9_] and unique; 1–8 nodes;"},"2347":{"id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic-46","page_id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/dynamic#lifecycle-and-events","content":"a tool node naming a tool the agent does not have becomes an AI node;"},"2348":{"id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic-47","page_id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/dynamic#lifecycle-and-events","content":"depends keeps known ids and gains any node a {{id.result}} template references;"},"2349":{"id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic-48","page_id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/dynamic#lifecycle-and-events","content":"a cycle, a bad id or an empty/oversized graph rejects the draft."},"2350":{"id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic-49","page_id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/dynamic#lifecycle-and-events","content":"Any failure falls back to the template graph (first registered tool → ai → ai). The drafting call's usage is reported on cost:update. Override in tests with __test.dynamicGraph on createAgent."},"2351":{"id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic-50","page_id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/dynamic#lifecycle-and-events","content":"AI nodes run without tools and do not stream stream:token; the session's done carries the last node's output, and each node's result is on workflow:step:done.output. With telemetry on, each run is one trace: a workflow.run root (generated: true, workflowId, workflowName) with the node spans under it, so it appears on the admin Workflows page."},"2352":{"id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic-51","page_id":"/docs/workflows/dynamic","tags":[],"type":"te