":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/static#approvals-and-orchestration","content":"Workflow tool steps use the same normalized tools and approval config as agent.run(). Run a workflow with session.runWorkflow to approve its gated steps in that session (your UI's approval card works unchanged):"},"2426":{"id":"/docs/workflows/static-57","page_id":"/docs/workflows/static","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/static#approvals-and-orchestration","content":"With telemetry on, a session run exports one workflow.run root (tagged with the session id), or nests under the chat turn that started it."},"2427":{"id":"/docs/workflows/static-58","page_id":"/docs/workflows/static","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/static#run-from-chat-workflowsexpose","content":"Set workflows: { expose: true, ... } and every session turn gets a run_workflow({ id, input }) tool whose description lists the registered workflows: id, name, description and the {{input.key}} names each one reads. The run happens in the calling session, so approvals land there too:"},"2428":{"id":"/docs/workflows/static-59","page_id":"/docs/workflows/static","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/static#run-from-chat-workflowsexpose","content":"expose: true is shorthand for {}: run_workflow and list_workflows (ids, names, descriptions, input keys) are on, build_workflow is off. Pass { run?, list?, build? } to choose. build_workflow({ task, name? }) has the model draft a workflow for an ad-hoc task and runs it in the session; with a name it is also saved to the store. To draft without running, call session.generateWorkflow(task), which returns a WorkflowGraph. Unnamed build_workflow drafts and generateWorkflow drafts feed the same repeat detection as dynamic workflows, without experimental.dynamicWorkflows: when a similar task comes up a second time (taskSimilarity; repeatAfter, similarityThreshold and autoPromptSave are read from experimental.dynamicWorkflows when set), the session emits workflow:save:prompt { workflowId, suggestedName, runCount, graph } and session.saveWorkflow(workflowId, name) stores it. workflowInputKeys(def) returns the {{input.key}} names a definition reads."},"2429":{"id":"/docs/workflows/static-60","page_id":"/docs/workflows/static","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/static#run-from-chat-workflowsexpose","content":"Parallel subagents (orchestration.parallel) apply to agent.run() / normal session.send, not to workflows.run()."},"2430":{"id":"/docs/workflows/static-61","page_id":"/docs/workflows/static","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/static#related","content":"Dynamic workflows — NL → graph → optional save as static def"},"2431":{"id":"/docs/workflows/static-62","page_id":"/docs/workflows/static","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/static#related","content":"Tools — tools referenced by name in steps"},"2432":{"id":"/docs/workflows/static-63","page_id":"/docs/workflows/static","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/static#related","content":"Orchestration — plan mode and parallel agent.run()"},"2433":{"id":"/docs/workflows/static-64","page_id":"/docs/workflows/static","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/static#related","content":"Configuration reference — workflows field table"},"2434":{"id":"/docs/workflows/static-65","page_id":"/docs/workflows/static","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/workflows/static#related","content":"Vitest: packages/core/src/phase3.test.ts (static workflow runs and is listable)"}},"count":2434},"sorting":{"language":"english","sortableProperties":["content","page_id","type","url"],"sortablePropertiesWithTypes":{"content":"string","page_id":"string","type":"string","url":"string"},"sorts":{"content":{"docs":{"1":615,"2":667,"3":616,"4":1601,"5":670,"6":636,"7":2413,"8":508,"9":339,"10":341,"11":1996,"12":1324,"13":847,"14":856,"15":1064,"16":2376,"17":1289,"18":834,"19":138,"20":2238,"21":142,"22":156,"23":153,"24":1652,"25":601,"26":1598,"27