package. Vue and Svelte share its state logic (reducers in @agentkit/client); their components are minimal and themed CSS is upcoming."],[1100,"@agentkit/runtime"],[1606,"@agentkit/runtime"],[1737,"@agentkit/runtime is the agent microkernel: a session log, a tool pipeline, prompt assembly, a model seam, and a loop — each one an ordinary plugin on the kernel."],[1820,"@agentkit/runtime ships only MemorySessionStore so it stays edge-capable. The Node-side implementations of the same seam live in @agentkit/core:"],[469,"@agentkit/server"],[1142,"@agentkit/server"],[2068,"@agentkit/server has four entry points with the same routes and hardening (body limit, random session ids, session cap, auth, tenant isolation, error mapping):"],[23,"@agentkit/svelte"],[475,"@agentkit/svelte"],[2234,"@agentkit/svelte stores"],[22,"@agentkit/vue"],[473,"@agentkit/vue"],[2272,"@agentkit/vue composables"],[477,"@agentkit/workspace"],[2117,"/answer"],[2114,"/approvals?sessionId=…"],[2111,"/approve / /reject"],[2156,"/artifacts?sessionId=…"],[2120,"/cancel"],[2078,"/capabilities"],[2102,"/events?sessionId=…"],[2105,"/events/all"],[1141,"/health"],[2075,"/health"],[2123,"/history?sessionId=…"],[2147,"/mcp"],[2153,"/mcp/:id/tools"],[2150,"/mcp/connect, /mcp/disconnect, /mcp/reload, /mcp/add, /mcp/remove, /mcp/auth"],[2126,"/mode"],[328,"/models"],[2081,"/models"],[1946,"/models/*"],[336,"/models/add"],[2087,"/models/add / /models/remove"],[332,"/models/default"],[2084,"/models/default"],[344,"/models/refresh"],[2093,"/models/refresh"],[340,"/models/test"],[2090,"/models/test"],[2096,"/models/usage"],[1944,"/rag/* (ingest posts { docs })"],[2162,"/rag/ingest, /rag/query"],[2159,"/rag/sources"],[2132,"/saveWorkflow"],[2108,"/send"],[2099,"/session"],[2129,"/todo/edit"],[1718,"/tree inside the CLI (or --tree at startup) shows what actually loaded and what any blocked plugin is still waiting for."],[2135,"/workflows, /workflows/:id"],[2138,"/workflows/:id"],[2144,"/workflows/generate"],[2141,"/w